==How to Acquire/Use (Domestic)==

*Build a [[chicken coop]] for breeding hens and drakes. When a [[Mallard]]s drake and hen is placed inside a chicken coop with sufficient fodder, it will occasionally lay [[Duck Egg]] that will hutch into [[Duckling]] and then turn into a [[Duck Hen]] or [[Duck Drake]].

*[[Animal Husbandry]] enables you to breed ducks.

*Drakes require food to produce fertile eggs.
*Drakes hold outside claimed areas require food to not degrade and die. Inside claimed area's they will go dormant.


